right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个约束函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是顶点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的逆质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是拉格朗日乘子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是柔度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 每帧的 XPBD 布料步（简化伪代码）&#10;FOR substep IN 1..substeps:&#10;    FOR each particle p:&#10;        p.vel += gravity * dt&#10;        p.prev = p.pos&#10;        p.pos += p.vel * dt&#10;&#10;    FOR iter IN 1..solver_iterations:&#10;        FOR each distance_constraint c in cloth:&#10;            C  = |p_a.pos - p_b.pos| - rest_length&#10;            solve_constraint(c, C)          # 更新 lambda 与两端质点位置&#10;        FOR each collision_body b in avatar:&#10;            project_particles_outside(b)    # 防穿模&#10;&#10;    FOR each particle p:&#10;        p.vel = (p.pos - p.prev) / dt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 每帧的 XPBD 布料步（简化伪代码）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FOR substep IN 1..substeps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR each particle p:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.vel += gravity * dt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.prev = p.pos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.pos += p.vel * dt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR iter IN 1..solver_iterations:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FOR each distance_constraint c in cloth:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            C  = |p_a.pos - p_b.pos| - rest_length</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            solve_constraint(c, C)          # 更新 lambda 与两端质点位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FOR each collision_body b in avatar:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            project_particles_outside(b)    # 防穿模</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR each particle p:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p.vel = (p.pos - p.prev) / dt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工程上的取舍很清楚：<strong>迭代次数决定质量也决定帧时间</strong>。移动端通常跑 2–4 个 substep、每步 1–3 次迭代，宁可让布料稍硬也不掉帧；这在长裙、大衣这类大面积垂坠物上会影响观感，所以品类优先级要在 <a href=\"../ar-conversion-ops/ar-asset-coverage-priority\">3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级</a> 里显式排定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"鞋类试穿\">鞋类试穿</h2><p>鞋的试穿不是布料问题，而是<strong>刚体+形变的贴合问题</strong>。它的技术栈有三块：</p>\n<p><strong>脚部追踪与尺寸测量</strong>。手机摄像头做脚部三维重建，输出脚长、脚宽、足弓高度、脚背围度。这里的精度要求很实际：鞋楦的宽窄半码差异通常在几毫米量级，测量误差大于这个数就没有参考价值。可行做法是用参考物（信用卡、A4 纸）做尺度标定，把相似变换定标成真实尺度——这和摄影测量的尺度定标是同一类问题（见 <a href=\"../3d-asset-production-spec/3d-scan-photogrammetry-pipeline\">3D 扫描与摄影测量生产</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>鞋楦与鞋面网格</strong>。一双可为试穿服务的鞋需要三层几何：外底（刚性）、鞋面（部分形变）、内里（贴合脚型）。真实生产中很难为每双鞋做完整内里，替代方案是<strong>用鞋楦数据代替内里做贴合判定</strong>，只渲染鞋面。</p>\n<p><strong>透视与遮挡</strong>。从上方视角看自己的脚时，鞋头会遮挡脚背的一部分，脚趾会从鞋口露出来。需要正确的深度缓冲而不是简单叠加，否则会出现「鞋穿在脚外面」的诡异效果。WebXR 的深度感知模块提供了 <code>&quot;depth-sensing&quot;</code> feature descriptor 与 <code>XRDepthInformation</code>（含 <code>XRCPUDepthInformation.getDepthInMeters</code> 与 <code>XRWebGLDepthInformation.texture</code>），用来做真实的遮挡；浏览器支持上目前 Chrome/Edge 自 90+ 起，Firefox 与 Safari 尚未支持（<a href=\"https://immersive-web.github.io/depth-sensing/\">WebXR Depth Sensing</a>）。在支持的设备上用深度遮挡，不支持的设备回退到平面命中测试加经验偏移。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>主要形变</th>\n<th>关键失败模式</th>\n<th>推荐路线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上衣/衬衫</td>\n<td>肩、袖、下摆垂坠</td>\n<td>穿模、袖长错位</td>\n<td>3D 蒙皮 + PBD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>裤/长裙</td>\n<td>大面积垂坠</td>\n<td>悬空、腿部干涉</td>\n<td>3D 蒙皮 + PBD（迭代更高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鞋</td>\n<td>局部形变的刚体贴合</td>\n<td>尺寸错、透视错</td>\n<td>刚体 + 脚部三维测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帽/配饰</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>定位偏移</td>\n<td>锚点 + 刚体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>眼镜</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>鼻梁位置错、瞳距错</td>\n<td>人脸关键点 + 刚体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>彩妆</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>色号显示偏差</td>\n<td>人脸网格 + 2D 纹理合成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"落地形态-静态图还是实时\">落地形态：静态图还是实时？</h2><p>同样的 3D 资产可以产出两种用户可见形态，选择取决于流量入口：</p>\n<p><strong>实时 AR</strong>：用户打开摄像头，商品实时叠加。它的价值是「我现在就看到」，代价是设备门槛（需要 ARKit/ARCore 能力）、性能约束、以及用户授权摄像头的摩擦。它的覆盖品类受限于能实时模拟的东西。</p>\n<p><strong>静态合成图</strong>：用户上传一张全身照，系统生成「穿着效果」的图片返回。它不需要摄像头权限、不需要实时性能、可以在服务端跑重模型，质量上限更高。代价是它本质上是生成模型，必须处理<strong>生成不实</strong>的风险——如果生成的图让衣服看起来比实际合身，退货反而会上升。这在 <a href=\"../ar-conversion-ops/tryon-conversion-return-impact\">试穿对转化/退货的影响</a> 里是核心议题。</p>\n<p>两种形态共用同一套资产与 SKU 绑定，差别只在下游消费者。这决定了资产层不应该假设消费方式，见 <a href=\"../asset-sku-serving/3d-asset-sku-bind-qc\">资产与 SKU 绑定及质检</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>虚拟试穿分两条技术路线：2D 图像生成式（VITON-HD / IDM-VTON / TryOnDiffusion 一系，输出静态图，有 FID/KID/LPIPS 类定量评测）与 3D 网格叠加式（实时渲染，验收标准需自建）。</li>\n<li>3D 试穿的三件套是人体追踪、商品网格蒙皮、布料模拟；衣服是软体，鞋是局部形变的刚体，两者失败模式不同。</li>\n<li>布料模拟的标准解法是 XPBD：约束投影迭代、柔度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与迭代次数解耦，移动端用少量 substep + 少量迭代换帧率。</li>\n<li>鞋试穿的关键是脚部测量精度——鞋楦宽窄的差异在几毫米量级，必须用参考物做尺度定标，再靠深度感知做正确遮挡。</li>\n<li>试穿模型的资产成本比展示模型高得多：需要蒙皮权重、双面材质、按尺码成套，这是 3D 路线的主要投入。</li>\n<li>实时 AR 与静态合成图共用同一套资产层，差别在下游消费者；静态合成图要额外处理生成不实的风险。</li>\n<li>尺码推荐（不渲染但直接降退货）见 <a href=\"size-recommend-avatar-fit\">尺码推荐与人台匹配</a>，家具眼镜美妆的锚点路线见 <a href=\"furniture-placement-beauty\">家具摆放/眼镜美妆 AR</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服装与鞋的虚拟试穿","id":"服装与鞋的虚拟试穿"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"两条路线各自的证据强度不同","id":"两条路线各自的证据强度不同"},{"level":2,"text":"3D 试穿的技术栈","id":"3d-试穿的技术栈"},{"level":3,"text":"人体追踪：从骨骼到稠密网格","id":"人体追踪-从骨骼到稠密网格"},{"level":3,"text":"商品网格的准备","id":"商品网格的准备"},{"level":3,"text":"布料模拟与穿模","id":"布料模拟与穿模"},{"level":2,"text":"鞋类试穿","id":"鞋类试穿"},{"level":2,"text":"落地形态：静态图还是实时？","id":"落地形态-静态图还是实时"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"面数预算、网格量化与模型压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/3d-asset-production-spec/model-polycount-compress"},"next":{"title":"尺码推荐与人台匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/ar-tryon-size/size-recommend-avatar-fit"}}